The most effective protection from a Cockatrice is a Lizard corpse, if
you eat it it will reverse the petrification (you get about three turns
to eat it.) I always carry a couple with me. The coolest thing about
those beasties is that you can weild them as a weapon that instantly
turns your opponent to stone (ONLY IF YOU WEAR GLOVES WHILE HANDLING IT
!!!)

As for healing your charachter there are at least four ways to do it.

1. Get naked for a Nurse and let her hit you. (if you are at max HP
then your max will go up !! )
2. Quaff a healing potion of any variety
3. Find an up staircase on a cleared level and rest on it ( 10 dot 100
times)
4. Spell of healing
5. Prayer (only if you are under 5 HP, AND can safely pray [every 300
turns])



